<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-27T13:25:59.938Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:25:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking the Ras Tanura oil refinery, oil pumping stations and Riyadh airport, while Saudi air defenses have intercepted missiles and drones. In response, the Saudi-led coalition has destroyed Houthi missile facilities and launch sites in Yemen. Iran, Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan have agreed to hold additional talks on the conflict, and Egypt's parliament has authorized military aid to Saudi Arabia. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPMU9tRHdmbzQ2ZHlsQzBDVmpqUEhlTk9meXgzN1VMOWlUMnlKOU1ibFRMQ1VQNDNjTkloUG9lb054S2JXZ2YwMS1MMXM4b1pwczl2clNyTHM5RGZVdnd6bzJXTVl4bW4yZ0pGTEV2aEV4dlR2cDNkc0lvNjVMN2ZScklvRDE3S1VyS0FoaC02Z3BqTHJPeTJrekxhM0dONmN0VzdXTmE5QjNfM0pIZ1Q2SHMtSkZzbFNqSThaN2RybDFBdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBGLU9IcTdIb3FzeEZTWDBLUEhKZktsRG9sQ25zb0xrQWc1YzhXSG9Pb29MZHRiQjljRHMzc0c4T1U1V2RUTGhWd0ZkVlE5SjdFUk83NlFPVmN1REE4YldfNm95NTNGZHJ2Nl9hSmF1cDQ0clB6cC1PNUVoZHo4Yms?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPWGZQYkpkZXFYZXFmZ2MzYjVXQ1JRUTFFU3FRS0lBMy1qV095bllLM0FUZ2ZLNlBrUmtROG11aHpOUkZ1cnlVb2E0ZllPQ1prZlgtSmltZG5rWXpFSWs2QnhEUlNvdkozYVkzbXFwbmFhdkJmTnYwMDZhaHdGR2hlVFdQQnlxNm1SQk9EWnN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPVEZPbnlhelpsZk1yY3U0YjhJSVRGNUF0aGFIdGo3NHZCVUhMbzl2VnhVclJlM250SFN4c3RiRzBMZ2o3cXNLNV